{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-czoi-joif-rkfo-d5hc","published":"2026-11-11T18:56:38Z","modified":"2026-11-16T02:35:03.651585487Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-45382"],"summary":"libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.19…","details":"libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.19, `decoder_context::decode_slice_unit_tiles` (libde265/decctx.cc:920) reads `pps.CtbAddrRStoTS[ctbAddrRS]` at line 966 where `ctbAddrRS = ctbY * ctbsWidth + ctbX` is computed from PPS-supplied `colBd[]`/`rowBd[]` arrays without validating the result against `CtbAddrRStoTS.size() == sps->PicSizeInCtbsY`. A malformed PPS that passes `set_derived_values` but encodes geometry inconsistent with the SPS produces a `ctbAddrRS` past the allocation, causing a 4-byte heap-buffer-overflow READ. Version 1.0.19 fixes the issue.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libde265","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/libde265"},"versions":["1.0.18-r0","1.1.1-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-czoi-joif-rkfo-d5hc.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-czoi-joif-rkfo-d5hc"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-45382"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-45382"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://alas.aws.amazon.com/AL2023/ALAS-2026-1974.html"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-54241"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-54240"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-45383"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2026-45382"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-45382"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-45382"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-hwhx-x2mq-ccr9"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"http://people.ubuntu.com/~ubuntu-security/cve/CVE-2026-45382"}],"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}